• { action: "schedule-cancel", id: "..." } - cancel a scheduled run before it fires

DIAGNOSTICS:
• { action: "doctor" } - read-only report for runtime paths, discovery, sessions, and intercom

${SUBAGENT_SAFETY_GUIDANCE}`;

